WEBVTT

00:00:18.930 --> 00:00:26.100
This warm asphalt feels incredible
against my cold skin!

00:00:26.100 --> 00:00:27.480
It's over!

00:00:27.480 --> 00:00:29.400
I'm spent.

00:00:30.440 --> 00:00:32.280
I'm starving!

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:34.450
What's your problem?!

00:00:34.450 --> 00:00:39.120
Learn how to cooperate!
Get on the same page as us!

00:00:39.120 --> 00:00:40.580
Same page?

00:00:40.580 --> 00:00:42.620
Hey!

00:00:42.620 --> 00:00:48.750
You always dribble and never pass!
Unlike swimming, it's a team sport!

00:00:48.750 --> 00:00:52.340
If I get past defenders,
we have a better chance to--

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:57.340
You know what I mean!
You're too much of a ball hog!

00:00:57.340 --> 00:00:59.430
You, too, Buu.

00:00:59.430 --> 00:01:01.010
Eh?!

00:01:01.010 --> 00:01:03.100
Huh?

00:01:03.100 --> 00:01:07.100
You like to shoot the ball from way afar.

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:10.360
That was... I thought it'd go in.

00:01:10.360 --> 00:01:12.400
That's called a ball hog.

00:01:12.400 --> 00:01:15.360
And you're not?!

00:01:15.360 --> 00:01:16.700
I'm open!

00:01:16.700 --> 00:01:21.370
If you can't make a play,
you always throw the ball away!

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:25.120
I'm threading the needle
to give you a chance!

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:27.250
Whatever, ball hog!

00:01:27.250 --> 00:01:29.500
--Ball hog! Ball hog!
--Captain, they're bickering.

00:01:29.500 --> 00:01:30.170
--It helps if you swim for it.
--Captain, they're bickering.

00:01:30.170 --> 00:01:31.920
--It helps if you swim for it.
--Leave it to me.

00:01:31.920 --> 00:01:34.510
Huh?! Are you saying it's my fault?!

00:01:34.510 --> 00:01:37.010
Listen up, guys!

00:01:37.010 --> 00:01:40.600
As of today...

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:44.930
We're making jerseys
for the water polo club!

00:01:44.930 --> 00:01:46.350
--Huh?
--Eh?

00:01:46.350 --> 00:01:48.060
Where'd that come from?

00:01:48.060 --> 00:01:50.860
I forgot to mention it earlier.

00:01:50.860 --> 00:01:52.940
That's your reason?

00:01:52.940 --> 00:01:55.490
So, we're all gonna match?

00:01:55.490 --> 00:02:00.530
Yup! You ever notice how everyone
wears their own thing?

00:02:01.830 --> 00:02:03.160
Yeah...

00:02:03.160 --> 00:02:07.540
And don't worry about the cost.
We got club money!

00:02:07.540 --> 00:02:08.830
Ooh!

00:02:08.830 --> 00:02:10.830
Let's go all out!

00:02:10.830 --> 00:02:14.750
However! Since a full
order's too pricey...

00:02:14.750 --> 00:02:16.880
How's this?

00:02:16.880 --> 00:02:22.720
I picked out these patterns where you
can put the team name on 'em.

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:24.510
I like it!

00:02:24.510 --> 00:02:27.060
--Ooh!
--That's nice!
--Right?

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:29.810
--Cool, eh?
--That's sweet!

00:02:29.810 --> 00:02:37.070
The back can have our club name,
but let's put words on the front.

00:02:37.070 --> 00:02:39.570
What do you mean by "words"?

00:02:39.570 --> 00:02:43.160
Like, "victory".... or something.

00:02:43.160 --> 00:02:44.450
--Ah.
--Oh.

00:02:44.450 --> 00:02:45.490
Like the one on my back!

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:46.580
"Unbeatable"

00:02:45.490 --> 00:02:46.580
Like the one on my back!

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:47.750
"Unbeatable"

00:02:46.580 --> 00:02:47.750
Yeah, yeah! Everyone pick out words that
represent your feelings for water polo.

00:02:47.750 --> 00:02:54.290
Yeah, yeah! Everyone pick out words that
represent your feelings for water polo.

00:02:54.290 --> 00:02:56.760
We'll choose our favorite.

00:02:56.760 --> 00:02:59.510
I'm going with "talent."

00:02:59.510 --> 00:03:02.180
I like "onwards."

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:05.010
How about "challenge"?

00:03:05.010 --> 00:03:08.100
"Camaraderie" sounds good.

00:03:08.100 --> 00:03:12.310
You're all so quick. Minato?

00:03:12.310 --> 00:03:14.900
No ideas just yet.

00:03:14.900 --> 00:03:20.860
We'll pick at tomorrow's practice.
There's a 30% off sale now, so--

00:03:20.860 --> 00:03:23.450
I don't have to help, right?

00:03:23.450 --> 00:03:25.200
--Eh?
--Huh?

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:29.080
Because I don't need a jersey.

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.580
--Huh?
--What?

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.920
Aww! But we'll all match!

00:03:33.920 --> 00:03:36.130
I have a jersey.

00:03:36.130 --> 00:03:38.000
Like I said...

00:03:38.000 --> 00:03:40.170
Now, now...

00:05:15.390 --> 00:05:18.940
"Episode 7: Auspicious Day"

00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:21.400
"Episode 7: Auspicious Day"
Intensity... Fierce Battle...
Strike First...

00:05:21.400 --> 00:05:25.400
Intensity... Fierce Battle...
Strike First...

00:05:25.400 --> 00:05:29.320
All of 'em are missing that "something"!

00:05:32.620 --> 00:05:32.910
Hence the jerseys?

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.910
"Bike"
"Pedestrian Lane"

00:05:32.910 --> 00:05:34.910
Hence the jerseys?

00:05:36.540 --> 00:05:40.290
The guys aren't coming together well.

00:05:40.290 --> 00:05:46.380
But with the same jerseys,
maybe they'll act as one.

00:05:46.380 --> 00:05:47.760
I see.

00:05:47.760 --> 00:05:52.350
Still, Amiami does his own thing.

00:05:57.730 --> 00:05:59.560
Hey, Big Bro. I wanna--

00:05:59.560 --> 00:06:00.900
Wait!

00:06:00.900 --> 00:06:02.400
Huh?

00:06:06.110 --> 00:06:10.910
I feel one coming--a real good expression.

00:06:12.330 --> 00:06:14.450
Auspicious day!

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.250
That's not it.

00:06:19.250 --> 00:06:20.750
Huh?

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:38.270
"Our feelings for water polo," huh?

00:07:03.630 --> 00:07:06.960
Beat: To win against.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:08.380
Beat.

