--Huh?
--Nuh-uh!

00:19:09.600 --> 00:19:11.810
It's "water ball," right?!

00:19:11.810 --> 00:19:14.110
Officially, it's "water polo."

00:19:14.110 --> 00:19:16.320
Isn't polo the horse thing?

00:19:16.320 --> 00:19:20.320
I don't know the origins,
but it's "water polo."

00:19:20.320 --> 00:19:22.410
For real?

00:19:23.530 --> 00:19:27.910
And to think it's written
this big... So lame!

00:19:27.910 --> 00:19:30.790
You just said it was cool!

00:19:31.880 --> 00:19:37.760
Still, I think it works out.
If anything, this team is "strange."

00:19:37.760 --> 00:19:39.260
Positive thinking!

00:19:39.260 --> 00:19:41.260
Sorry, dudes!

00:19:41.260 --> 00:19:45.720
Amihama really likes wearing
jerseys a certain way.

00:19:46.930 --> 00:19:49.060
I'm home!

00:19:49.060 --> 00:19:50.850
I hate it!

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:51.600
Huh?

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:54.270
I can't go to school tomorrow!

00:19:54.270 --> 00:19:56.270
It's fine!

00:19:56.270 --> 00:19:58.360
Welcome home.

00:19:58.360 --> 00:20:00.200
This is all your fault!

00:20:00.200 --> 00:20:01.780
Huh?

00:20:01.780 --> 00:20:06.370
I wanted to discuss haircuts,
but you ignored me.

00:20:06.370 --> 00:20:10.290
How is it my fault? Wait, discuss?

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:12.580
That's what I came for!

00:20:13.580 --> 00:20:17.460
This is the worst. I look strange.

00:20:18.670 --> 00:20:20.420
Strange is good.

00:20:20.420 --> 00:20:21.420
Huh?

00:20:21.420 --> 00:20:23.720
Strange rhymes with change.

00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:28.180
You cut your hair 'cuz you
wanna change, right?

00:20:29.270 --> 00:20:31.180
Being strange sucks.

00:20:31.180 --> 00:20:32.690
Huh?

00:20:32.690 --> 00:20:35.360
You're supposed to say it's not strange.

00:20:35.360 --> 00:20:37.860
Oh, right.

00:20:37.860 --> 00:20:42.200
It's not strange.
It's Okayama's best haircut.

00:20:43.660 --> 00:20:44.660
Better.

00:20:44.660 --> 00:20:46.030
Yup!

00:20:47.370 --> 00:20:49.580
Whatever...

00:20:49.580 --> 00:20:54.620
Speaking of which, he sure has changed.

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:56.000
Yeah.

00:20:56.000 --> 00:21:00.170
He's totally different
than back in junior high.

00:21:07.010 --> 00:21:10.680
I wonder what I'll learn today.

00:21:10.680 --> 00:21:14.350
Let's see... Still haven't seen this one.

00:21:19.480 --> 00:21:22.240
What the hell was that?!

00:21:22.240 --> 00:21:26.610
Talk about half-assing it!
That pass was pathetic!

00:21:26.610 --> 00:21:28.030
I'm sorry!

00:21:28.030 --> 00:21:32.500
You're giving up shots on goal!
Don't you get it?!

00:21:32.500 --> 00:21:34.710
What's this?

00:21:34.710 --> 00:21:38.840
Hey! I said only to film the games!

00:21:38.840 --> 00:21:40.670
Sorry, Senpai!

00:21:45.090 --> 00:21:48.550
This is... me?

00:21:58.520 --> 00:22:05.360
<i>I'm not gonna regret it</i>

00:22:05.360 --> 00:22:11.160
<i>I honestly won't</i>

00:22:12.160 --> 00:22:18.920
<i>The stairs to that dear future</i>

00:22:18.920 --> 00:22:27.050
<i>Are crumbling down</i>

00:22:27.050 --> 00:22:31.470
<i>Just who are they</i>

00:22:33.810 --> 00:22:38.940
<i>There's a me just like me at my side</i>

00:22:38.940 --> 00:22:41.940
<i>Laughing</i>

00:22:46.190 --> 00:22:49.530
<i>All the many sights and</i>

00:22:49.530 --> 00:22:52.990
<i>All the words you left behind</i>

00:22:52.990 --> 00:22:59.790
<i>Are looking a little warped</i>

00:22:59.790 --> 00:23:03.210
<i>Someone, anyone tell me</i>

00:23:03.210 --> 00:23:06.170
<i>It hurts, it hurts, it hurts</i>

00:23:06.170 --> 00:23:14.510
<i>What am I suddenly crying for?</i>
